<p>Your melee and ranged attacks leave your foes unable to focus on any complex actions, giving them a stacking 3% chance of failure the next time they try to use a talent (to a maximum of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">9%, 21%, 30%, 36%, 39%</acronym>).</p><p>If any effect causes the target's turn to fail they fumble and injure themself, taking <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">126, 163, 191, 214, 234</acronym> physical damage.</p><p>If the turn loss was caused by this effect then Fumble is removed.</p><p>The damage dealt increases with your Cunning.</p><p></p>